-- הסכם קיבוצי — שעות פעילות גן, מחנכי כיתה והקצאת שעות למורים בעלי
-- תפקידים בחטיבות ביניים (17.9.2013), the September 2013 agreement: for
-- 27.8.2013–30.6.2015, on Ofek Hadash terms. Kindergarten-activity hours,
-- paid at 125% of the hour value, 18 a half-year at most, on an approved
-- work plan and a report; the early end of celebration days in the
-- kindergarten cancelled; a homeroom teacher may use up to two individual
-- hours to manage the class; §§15(ה) and 17(ה) of the base agreement
-- cancelled and §§15א and 17א added — role hours for grade, social-education
-- and subject coordinators in grades 7–9, kept to a minimum of frontal
-- teaching; a choice of fewer hours or tuition refunds for a degree; the
-- negotiations on guidance roles and colleges; eight complexity levels from
-- תשע"ד, by a further agreement, with principals' pay frozen until then;
-- the next wage negotiation; earlier terms kept; exhaustion of claims, §155(א)
-- of the base agreement no longer applying; and industrial peace.
--
-- It amends and applies the base agreement of 25.12.2008, as the
-- completion agreement of 29.2.2012 amended it, so it imports what it
-- changes or relies on: §§15 and 17 (the work week), §31 (the hour value)
-- and the completion agreement's §31(ב) by the hours of a full position and
-- the kindergarten teacher's position base, §34 (studies), §66 (the
-- levels), §153 (earlier terms), §155 and the completion agreement's §155(ב)
-- populations. §14(ו) follows §3 of the follow-up committee's decision of
-- 12.3.2013 and §17(ד) meets the deferral of 22.7.2013: both are imported.
-- The text of the §15א this agreement adds stops where the scan skips a
-- page; the complete CMS copy of the agreement carries it and is encoded
-- there.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT parties
IMPORT `base-agreement-common`
IMPORT `base-agreement-4`
IMPORT `base-agreement-15`
IMPORT `base-agreement-17`
IMPORT `base-agreement-31`
IMPORT `base-agreement-34`
IMPORT `base-agreement-39`
IMPORT `base-agreement-66`
IMPORT `base-agreement-153`
IMPORT `2012-02-29_ofek-hadash_amendment_hascam-hashlama`
IMPORT `2013-03-12_ofek-hadash_vaadat-maakav_principal-pay-complexity`
IMPORT `2013-07-22_ofek-hadash_last-phase-deferral`

-- What the parties must, may or may not do under this agreement.
DECLARE `September 2013 agreement action` IS ONE OF
    `prepare a work plan for the kindergarten-activity hours`
    `approve the work plan for the kindergarten-activity hours`
    `set how kindergarten-activity hours are reported`
    `use up to two individual hours to manage the class`
    `continue negotiating Ofek Hadash terms for teaching employees in guidance roles`
    `begin negotiating the reform for teaching employees in colleges and seminars`
    `hold talks on the new principals' tables and the changes to §66`
    `begin negotiating the wage agreement for תשע"ו`
    `negotiate applying a framework agreement's cost to teaching employees`
    `negotiate further economic demands for the agreement's period`
    `strike, lock out or disrupt work over a matter the September 2013 agreement settles`

§ `הסכם ספטמבר 2013 — 17.9.2013`

-- akn:preamble The agreement's frame: a label row with no text of its own.
