-- akn:preamble/p2 The registration stamp: registered as a collective agreement on 06-01-2014, number 244/2013; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p3 The date of signing, 17 September 2013; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p4 The first party, the State, and who represents it; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p5 The first party's short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p6 "On the one side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p7 The second party, the teachers' union, and who represents it; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p8 The second party's short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p9 "On the other side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p10 A recital: the base agreement of 25.12.08 and its short names ("ההסכם הכולל", "רפורמת אופק חדש", "הרפורמה"); no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p11 A recital: the completion agreement of 29.2.2012 ("הסכם ההשלמה"); no rule.

-- A recital: the base agreement's agreed term runs to 1.9.2013 — the day
-- its §4(ב) names.
@ref akn:preamble/p12
`the base agreement's term, as the September 2013 agreement recites it, ends on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2013

#ASSERT DATE_SERIAL `the base agreement's term, as the September 2013 agreement recites it, ends on` EQUALS DATE_SERIAL `the fixed term ends on`

-- akn:preamble/p13 A recital: the parties reached agreements in negotiation and anchor them in a collective agreement; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p14 The words of agreement that introduce the clauses; no rule.

§§ `1 המבוא`

@ref akn:art_1
`the preamble of the September 2013 agreement binds as the agreement` MEANS TRUE

§§ `2 לשון`

-- A word in the masculine reads in the feminine and the plural too, and
-- the other way, unless said otherwise in so many words.
@ref akn:art_2
GIVEN `said otherwise in so many words` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a word of the September 2013 agreement reads in every gender and number` `said otherwise in so many words` IF
    NOT `said otherwise in so many words`

§§ `3 תחולה`

-- Every employee ranked on the teaching employees' scale and employed in a
-- school or educational institution in the civil service: kindergartens,
-- primary schools and junior highs, special-education schools and classes,
-- Matia, therapeutic centres, Pais clusters, Pisga centres, agricultural
-- farms, marine centres and kindergarten clusters — the workplaces of §3
-- of the completion agreement, whose type this reuses.
@ref akn:art_3 akn:art_3/p1
GIVEN `ranked on the teaching employees' scale and in the civil service` IS A BOOLEAN, w IS A `kind of workplace`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `covered by the September 2013 agreement` `ranked on the teaching employees' scale and in the civil service` w IF
    `ranked on the teaching employees' scale and in the civil service` AND NOT w EQUALS `another workplace`

#ASSERT `covered by the September 2013 agreement` TRUE `a kindergarten cluster`
#ASSERT NOT `covered by the September 2013 agreement` TRUE `another workplace`

§§ `4 תקופת ההסכם`

-- From 27.8.2013 to 30.6.2015, both days in (conventions dates.start and
-- dates.end).
@ref akn:art_4 akn:art_4/p1
`the September 2013 agreement's period opens on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 27 8 2013
`the September 2013 agreement's period ends on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 30 6 2015

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in the September 2013 agreement's period` d IF
    d `is on or after` `the September 2013 agreement's period opens on` AND d `is on or before` `the September 2013 agreement's period ends on`

§§ `5 הגדרות`

-- The definitions of §7 of the base agreement, as §5 of the completion
-- agreement amended them, apply here, and so does any later change to
-- them: a term reads as §7 defines it on the day it is read.
@ref akn:art_5 akn:art_5/p1
GIVEN `§7's definition on the day` IS A STRING
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `the definition the September 2013 agreement reads` `§7's definition on the day` IS
    `§7's definition on the day`

§§ `6 שעות פעילות גן`

-- (א)–(ב): a kindergarten teacher on the reform's terms is paid for
-- kindergarten activities 125% of the hour value computed by §31(א)(3) of
-- the base agreement — the hour of school activities, read as a
-- kindergarten teacher's hour of kindergarten activity — and §31(ב) as the
-- completion agreement replaced it: the combined salary and the
-- pensionable role allowances, over the hours of her full position (the
-- kindergarten teacher's position base) times 4.33.
@ref akn:art_6 akn:art_6__para_a akn:art_6__para_b
`the share of the hour value a kindergarten-activity hour is paid` MEANS 125%

GIVEN p IS A `pay for the hour value`, charge IS A `kindergarten teacher's charge`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the pay for a kindergarten-activity hour` p charge IS
    `the share of the hour value a kindergarten-activity hour is paid`
    TIMES `the hour value by the hours of a full position` (`the base under 31(א)(2)–(4)` p) (`a kindergarten teacher's position base` charge)

-- A placeholder kindergarten teacher in charge whose base is 30.4 × 4.33 ×
-- 100: an hour value of 100, an activity hour of 125.
`a kindergarten teacher for the activity hour` MEANS
    `pay for the hour value` WITH
        `combined salary`             IS 13000
        `special-education allowance` IS 0
        `pensionable role allowances` IS 163.2
        `a special-education teacher substituting in a special-education class` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `the pay for a kindergarten-activity hour` `a kindergarten teacher for the activity hour` `the teacher in charge of the kindergarten` EQUALS 125

-- (ג): the hours are allotted by the kindergarten's needs, and never more
-- than 18 a half-year ("יותר מ־18" is refused, 18 is not).
@ref akn:art_6__para_c
`kindergarten-activity hours a half-year at most` MEANS 18

GIVEN hours IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an allotment of kindergarten-activity hours for a half-year stands` hours IF
    NOT hours `is above` `kindergarten-activity hours a half-year at most`

#ASSERT `an allotment of kindergarten-activity hours for a half-year stands` 18
#ASSERT NOT `an allotment of kindergarten-activity hours for a half-year stands` 19

-- (ד)(1)–(3): the kindergarten activities.
@ref akn:art_6__para_d akn:art_6__para_d__subpara_1 akn:art_6__para_d__subpara_2 akn:art_6__para_d__subpara_3
DECLARE `kindergarten activity under the September 2013 agreement` IS ONE OF
    `staff meetings`
    `an individual meeting with parents and child`
    `an activity after kindergarten hours, such as a theme party or an end-of-year party`

-- (ה): the hours are done by a work plan the kindergarten teacher prepares
-- at the start of each half of the school year, which the kindergarten's
-- supervisor approves. The text sets no day for either (convention
-- dates.no-deadline).
@ref akn:art_6__para_e
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `September 2013 agreement action`
DECIDE `the kindergarten-activity work plan` IS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MUST  `prepare a work plan for the kindergarten-activity hours`
    HENCE (PARTY `the supervisor`
           MAY   `approve the work plan for the kindergarten-activity hours`)

-- (ו): an activity on her day off is paid as (א) pays it.
@ref akn:art_6__para_f
GIVEN p IS A `pay for the hour value`, charge IS A `kindergarten teacher's charge`, `on her day off` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the pay for a kindergarten-activity hour, on her day off or not` p charge `on her day off` IS
    `the pay for a kindergarten-activity hour` p charge

-- (ח): the Ministry sets from time to time how the hours are reported.
@ref akn:art_6__para_h
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `September 2013 agreement action`
DECIDE `the reporting of kindergarten-activity hours` IS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MAY   `set how kindergarten-activity hours are reported`

-- (ז) and (ט): the pay is conditional on her report of the hours done and
-- on the supervisor's approval of the work plan, both submitted by the day
-- the Ministry set; it is paid with the salary of the month after the one
-- the hours were done in (convention dates.salary-month: a month is its
-- first day).
@ref akn:art_6__para_g akn:art_6__para_i
GIVEN `month the hours were done` IS A DATE, `reported by the Ministry's day` IS A BOOLEAN, `the plan approved by the Ministry's day` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
DECIDE `the salary month kindergarten-activity hours are paid with` `month the hours were done` `reported by the Ministry's day` `the plan approved by the Ministry's day` IS
    IF `reported by the Ministry's day` AND `the plan approved by the Ministry's day`
    THEN JUST (IF DATE_MONTH `month the hours were done` EQUALS 12
               THEN DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 (DATE_YEAR `month the hours were done` PLUS 1)
               ELSE DATE_FROM_DMY 1 (DATE_MONTH `month the hours were done` PLUS 1) (DATE_YEAR `month the hours were done`))
    ELSE NOTHING

#ASSERT `the salary month kindergarten-activity hours are paid with` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 12 2013) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2014)
#ASSERT `the salary month kindergarten-activity hours are paid with` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 10 2013) TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

-- (י): on the pay for these hours, provident-fund contributions for an
-- annuity of 5% by the employer and 5% from the employee's salary, on the
-- principles of the agreement of 17.12.98.
@ref akn:art_6__para_j
`the employer's contribution on kindergarten-activity pay` MEANS 5%
`the employee's contribution on kindergarten-activity pay` MEANS 5%

GIVEN pay IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the provident contributions on kindergarten-activity pay` pay IS
    pay TIMES (`the employer's contribution on kindergarten-activity pay` PLUS `the employee's contribution on kindergarten-activity pay`)

#ASSERT `the provident contributions on kindergarten-activity pay` 1000 EQUALS 100

§§ `7 ערבי חגיגות עם הורים בגן הילדים`

-- The option of ending the kindergarten day at 11:00 on a celebration day
-- (Hanukkah, Purim, the end of the year) held with parents in the
-- afternoon, and at 11:30 on a morning Purim celebration, is cancelled: the
-- day ends at its regular hour — the end of the kindergarten's hours the
-- completion agreement's §75 sets for that day of the week. Minutes from
-- midnight; from the agreement's period on.
@ref akn:art_7 akn:art_7/p1
GIVEN `day of the week` IS A NUMBER, `an afternoon celebration` IS A BOOLEAN, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the end of a kindergarten day on a celebration` `day of the week` `an afternoon celebration` d IS
    IF d `is on or after` `the September 2013 agreement's period opens on`
    THEN at (`a kindergarten's hours that day` `day of the week`) 1
    ELSE IF `an afternoon celebration` THEN 660 ELSE 690

#ASSERT `the end of a kindergarten day on a celebration` 3 TRUE (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 12 2013) EQUALS 840

§§ `8 מחנכי כיתה`

-- Notwithstanding §§15(ג) and 17(ג) of the base agreement, a homeroom
-- teacher may use up to two of the individual hours those subsections set
-- for managing the class, by the Ministry's guidance. "עד שעתיים" is the
-- most he may use, and two are in (the exception recorded under convention
-- thresholds.until).
@ref akn:art_8 akn:art_8/p1
`individual hours a homeroom teacher may use for the class at most` MEANS 2

GIVEN hours IS A NUMBER, w IS A `work week`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a homeroom teacher may use individual hours for managing the class` hours w IF
        hours AT MOST `individual hours a homeroom teacher may use for the class at most`
    AND hours AT MOST w's `individual hours`

GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `September 2013 agreement action`
DECIDE `a homeroom teacher's individual hours for the class` IS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MAY   `use up to two individual hours to manage the class`

#ASSERT `a homeroom teacher may use individual hours for managing the class` 2 `a primary teacher's full week`
#ASSERT `a homeroom teacher may use individual hours for managing the class` 2 `a junior-high teacher's full week`
#ASSERT NOT `a homeroom teacher may use individual hours for managing the class` 3 `a primary teacher's full week`

§§ `9 הקצאת שעות למורים בעלי תפקידים בחטיבות ביניים`

-- (א): §17(ה) of the base agreement — the grade coordinator's week in a
-- junior high — is cancelled, from the agreement's period on (convention
-- dates.commencement).
-- F-ofek-hadash-september-2013-b: §§21(ב) and 22(ד), which the completion
-- agreement added, still divide a special-education grade coordinator's
-- week by §§15(ה) and 17(ה), which (א) here and §10(א) cancel. The reading
-- adopted (convention reading.referral): their referral took in the table
-- as printed, so it goes on dividing that week.
@ref akn:art_9 akn:art_9__para_a
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `§17(ה) of the base agreement is in force on` d IF
    NOT d `is on or after` `the September 2013 agreement's period opens on`

#ASSERT NOT `§17(ה) of the base agreement is in force on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2013)

-- §17א as (ב) adds it. Its opening: a junior-high teacher filling a role
-- below keeps §17's week, and is allotted hours for the role, in the
-- school, as follows. The same rules come back in §15א (§10) for grades 7–9
-- of a primary school, with §15's week and the classes of grades 7–9: so
-- they are written once, taking the week and the classes they count.
@ref akn:art_9__para_b
DECLARE `role holder under §§15א and 17א` IS ONE OF
    `the grade coordinator of §§15א and 17א` HAS `classes in his grade` IS A NUMBER
    `the social-education coordinator of §§15א and 17א`
    `a subject coordinator of §§15א and 17א` HAS `hours the principal allots him from the pool` IS A NUMBER

@desc A role holder's position, as far as §§15א(ד) and 17א(ד)–(ה) ask.
DECLARE `role holder's position under §§15א and 17א` HAS
    `frontal hours by the work-week table`  IS A NUMBER @desc the frontal hours of his position by §15's or §17's table
    `individual hours in his position`      IS A NUMBER
    `a full position without age hours`     IS A BOOLEAN
    `frontal hours in the upper division`   IS A NUMBER @desc in an attached junior high, the frontal hours he teaches in the upper division (§17א(ה)); 0 elsewhere

-- (א): a grade coordinator of one of grades 7–9, the grade having 4
-- classes or more, is allotted, together: (1) half an hour a class in the
-- grade, 6 a week at most, in place of frontal hours; (2) half an hour a
-- class in the grade, up to the individual hours of his position, in place
-- of individual hours. (ב): a social-education coordinator, 0.4 of an hour
-- a class counted, in place of frontal hours. (ג): a subject coordinator,
-- from a pool for all the subject coordinators of half an hour a class
-- counted, what the principal allots him, one hour at most, in place of
-- frontal hours.
`the grade coordinator's hours a class` MEANS 0.5
`the grade coordinator's frontal role hours at most` MEANS 6
`the social-education coordinator's hours a class` MEANS 0.4
`the subject coordinators' pool a class` MEANS 0.5
`a subject coordinator's hours from the pool at most` MEANS 1

GIVEN r IS A `role holder under §§15א and 17א`, `classes counted` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `role hours in place of frontal hours, as (א)–(ג) compute them` r `classes counted` IS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `the grade coordinator of §§15א and 17א` g
    THEN IF g AT LEAST 4
         THEN min (`the grade coordinator's hours a class` TIMES g) `the grade coordinator's frontal role hours at most`
         ELSE 0
    WHEN `the social-education coordinator of §§15א and 17א`
    THEN `the social-education coordinator's hours a class` TIMES `classes counted`
    WHEN `a subject coordinator of §§15א and 17א` a
    THEN min a `a subject coordinator's hours from the pool at most`

GIVEN r IS A `role holder under §§15א and 17א`, pos IS A `role holder's position under §§15א and 17א`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `role hours in place of individual hours` r pos IS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `the grade coordinator of §§15א and 17א` g
    THEN IF g AT LEAST 4
         THEN min (`the grade coordinator's hours a class` TIMES g) (pos's `individual hours in his position`)
         ELSE 0
    OTHERWISE 0

GIVEN `classes counted` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the subject coordinators' pool` `classes counted` IS
    `the subject coordinators' pool a class` TIMES `classes counted`

GIVEN allotments IS A LIST OF NUMBER
      `classes counted` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the principal's allotment from the pool stands` allotments `classes counted` IF
        sum allotments AT MOST `the subject coordinators' pool` `classes counted`
    AND all (GIVEN a YIELD a AT MOST `a subject coordinator's hours from the pool at most`) allotments

-- (ד): all this is subject to the role holder teaching, in fact, at least:
-- 12 frontal hours a week in a full position; in a part position, or with
-- age hours, 50% of the frontal hours of his position by the work-week
-- table, and never fewer than 6 for a grade coordinator or 8 for a subject
-- or social-education coordinator. (ה): in an attached junior high, the
-- frontal hours he teaches in the upper division count towards it too.
-- F-ofek-hadash-september-2013-c: the text does not say what becomes of
-- role hours (א)–(ג) compute that would take him below the minimum (nor
-- does §15א(ד), which the CMS copy prints whole). The reading adopted
-- (convention reading.subject-to): they are allotted up to the minimum,
-- and no further.
`frontal hours a full-position role holder teaches at least` MEANS 12
`the share of the table's frontal hours a part-position role holder teaches at least` MEANS 50%

GIVEN r IS A `role holder under §§15א and 17א`, pos IS A `role holder's position under §§15א and 17א`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the frontal minimum of` r pos IS
    IF pos's `a full position without age hours`
    THEN `frontal hours a full-position role holder teaches at least`
    ELSE max (`the share of the table's frontal hours a part-position role holder teaches at least` TIMES pos's `frontal hours by the work-week table`)
             (CONSIDER r
              WHEN `the grade coordinator of §§15א and 17א` g THEN 6
              OTHERWISE 8)

GIVEN r IS A `role holder under §§15א and 17א`, `classes counted` IS A NUMBER, pos IS A `role holder's position under §§15א and 17א`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `role hours in place of frontal hours` r `classes counted` pos IS
    min (`role hours in place of frontal hours, as (א)–(ג) compute them` r `classes counted`)
        (`not below zero` (pos's `frontal hours by the work-week table` PLUS pos's `frontal hours in the upper division` MINUS `the frontal minimum of` r pos))

GIVEN r IS A `role holder under §§15א and 17א`, `classes counted` IS A NUMBER, pos IS A `role holder's position under §§15א and 17א`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `frontal hours a role holder teaches` r `classes counted` pos IS
    pos's `frontal hours by the work-week table` PLUS pos's `frontal hours in the upper division` MINUS `role hours in place of frontal hours` r `classes counted` pos

-- (ה) ¶2: in an attached junior high, the percentage role allowance is
-- paid at the junior high's rate (§39).
GIVETH A `school stage`
DECIDE `the stage whose role-allowance rate a role holder in an attached junior high is paid` IS
    `a junior high school`

#ASSERT `the role rate` (`subject coordinator` `the stage whose role-allowance rate a role holder in an attached junior high is paid`) EQUALS 8%

-- A full-position junior-high teacher, §17's week: 23 frontal, 4
-- individual hours.
GIVEN `upper-division frontal hours` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `role holder's position under §§15א and 17א`
DECIDE `a full-position junior-high role holder, teaching upper-division hours` `upper-division frontal hours` IS
    `role holder's position under §§15א and 17א` WITH
        `frontal hours by the work-week table` IS `a junior-high teacher's full week`'s `frontal hours`
        `individual hours in his position`     IS `a junior-high teacher's full week`'s `individual hours`
        `a full position without age hours`    IS TRUE
        `frontal hours in the upper division`  IS `upper-division frontal hours`

-- A grade coordinator of a 6-class grade: 3 hours off the frontal and 3
-- off the individual hours; of a 14-class grade, 6 and 4.
#ASSERT `role hours in place of frontal hours` (`the grade coordinator of §§15א and 17א` 6) 30 (`a full-position junior-high role holder, teaching upper-division hours` 0) EQUALS 3
#ASSERT `role hours in place of individual hours` (`the grade coordinator of §§15א and 17א` 6) (`a full-position junior-high role holder, teaching upper-division hours` 0) EQUALS 3
#ASSERT `role hours in place of frontal hours` (`the grade coordinator of §§15א and 17א` 14) 30 (`a full-position junior-high role holder, teaching upper-division hours` 0) EQUALS 6
#ASSERT `role hours in place of individual hours` (`the grade coordinator of §§15א and 17א` 14) (`a full-position junior-high role holder, teaching upper-division hours` 0) EQUALS 4
-- A grade of 3 classes: none.
#ASSERT `role hours in place of frontal hours` (`the grade coordinator of §§15א and 17א` 3) 30 (`a full-position junior-high role holder, teaching upper-division hours` 0) EQUALS 0
-- A subject coordinator allotted 1.5 hours: 1.
#ASSERT `role hours in place of frontal hours` (`a subject coordinator of §§15א and 17א` 1.5) 30 (`a full-position junior-high role holder, teaching upper-division hours` 0) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the principal's allotment from the pool stands` (LIST 1, 1, 1) 6
#ASSERT NOT `the principal's allotment from the pool stands` (LIST 1, 1, 1, 1) 6

-- F-ofek-hadash-september-2013-c's evidence: a full-time social-education
-- coordinator in a junior high of 30 classes is computed 12 hours, which
-- would leave him 11 frontal hours of the 12 (ד) asks; read as a limit, he
-- is allotted 11. With 3 frontal hours in the upper division of an attached
-- junior high, the whole 12.
`a social-education coordinator of 30 classes would fall below the frontal minimum` MEANS
    `a junior-high teacher's full week`'s `frontal hours`
        MINUS `role hours in place of frontal hours, as (א)–(ג) compute them` `the social-education coordinator of §§15א and 17א` 30
    LESS THAN `the frontal minimum of` `the social-education coordinator of §§15א and 17א` (`a full-position junior-high role holder, teaching upper-division hours` 0)
#ASSERT `a social-education coordinator of 30 classes would fall below the frontal minimum`
#ASSERT `role hours in place of frontal hours` `the social-education coordinator of §§15א and 17א` 30 (`a full-position junior-high role holder, teaching upper-division hours` 0) EQUALS 11
#ASSERT `role hours in place of frontal hours` `the social-education coordinator of §§15א and 17א` 30 (`a full-position junior-high role holder, teaching upper-division hours` 3) EQUALS 12

-- A part-time subject coordinator with 10 frontal hours by the table: the
-- minimum is 8, not 5.
#ASSERT `the frontal minimum of` (`a subject coordinator of §§15א and 17א` 1) (`role holder's position under §§15א and 17א` WITH `frontal hours by the work-week table` IS 10, `individual hours in his position` IS 2, `a full position without age hours` IS FALSE, `frontal hours in the upper division` IS 0) EQUALS 8

-- F-ofek-hadash-september-2013-b's evidence: the completion agreement's
-- §§21(ב) and 22(ד) still divide a special-education grade coordinator's
-- week by §§15(ה) and 17(ה), which are no longer in force.
`a special-education grade coordinator's week still points at a cancelled table` MEANS
        `a grade coordinator's week in a primary special-education school` 5 EQUALS `a primary grade coordinator's week` 5
    AND `a grade coordinator's week in a multi-stage special-education school` 5 FALSE EQUALS `a junior-high grade coordinator's week` 5
    AND NOT `§17(ה) of the base agreement is in force on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2013)
    AND NOT `§15(ה) of the base agreement is in force on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2013)
#ASSERT `a special-education grade coordinator's week still points at a cancelled table`

§§ `10 הקצאת שעות למורים בעלי תפקידים המלמדים בכיתות ז' עד ט' בבית ספר יסודי`

-- (א): §15(ה) of the base agreement — the grade coordinator's week in a
-- primary school with grades 7–9 — is cancelled, from the agreement's
-- period on.
@ref akn:art_10 akn:art_10__para_a
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `§15(ה) of the base agreement is in force on` d IF
    NOT d `is on or after` `the September 2013 agreement's period opens on`

-- (ב): §15א, as far as this copy prints it: a teacher in a primary school
-- with grade 7, 8 or 9, who teaches in those grades and fills a role it
-- lists. The scan passes from page 4 to page 6 here, and the rest of §15א
-- is in the complete CMS copy of this agreement, whose file encodes it on
-- the rules written in §9 above.
@ref akn:art_10__para_b
GIVEN `the school has grade 7, 8 or 9` IS A BOOLEAN, `teaches in those grades` IS A BOOLEAN, `fills a role §15א lists` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `§15א reaches the teacher` `the school has grade 7, 8 or 9` `teaches in those grades` `fills a role §15א lists` IF
    `the school has grade 7, 8 or 9` AND `teaches in those grades` AND `fills a role §15א lists`

§§ `11 עובדי הוראה הלומדים לקראת תואר ראשון או תואר שני`

-- Changing §34 of the base agreement: a teaching employee on the reform's
-- terms in a school or a kindergarten, studying for a first or second
-- degree and entitled to tuition refunds for it, may choose fewer weekly
-- frontal hours ("מענק שעות") or the refunds. ¶2: it is applied once the
-- parties agree the rules of how many hours, at no cost beyond what the
-- refunds cost now; until then §34 stands.
@ref akn:art_11 akn:art_11/p1 akn:art_11/p2
GIVEN `year starts` IS A DATE
      `studies for a first or second degree, entitled to refunds` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the parties agreed the rules of the hours grant` IS A BOOLEAN
      `approved by the exceptions committee` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A LIST OF `study benefit`
DECIDE `the study benefits open under the September 2013 agreement` `year starts` `studies for a first or second degree, entitled to refunds` `the parties agreed the rules of the hours grant` `approved by the exceptions committee` IS
    IF `studies for a first or second degree, entitled to refunds` AND `the parties agreed the rules of the hours grant`
    THEN LIST `fewer hours`, `tuition refunds`
    ELSE `the study benefits open to a reform teacher` `year starts` `approved by the exceptions committee`

#ASSERT `the study benefits open under the September 2013 agreement` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2014) TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS LIST `fewer hours`, `tuition refunds`
#ASSERT `the study benefits open under the September 2013 agreement` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2014) TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS LIST `tuition refunds`

§§ `12 עובדי הוראה בתפקידי הדרכה`

-- The parties go on negotiating Ofek Hadash terms for teaching employees in
-- guidance roles.
@ref akn:art_12 akn:art_12/p1
`continuing the negotiation on guidance roles` MEANS
    (PARTY `the State`
     MUST  `continue negotiating Ofek Hadash terms for teaching employees in guidance roles`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the teachers' union`
     MUST  `continue negotiating Ofek Hadash terms for teaching employees in guidance roles`)

§§ `13 עובדי הוראה במכללות ובסמינרים להכשרת עובדי הוראה`

-- After the Leon committee's conclusions, and by 15.10.2013 at the latest,
-- the parties begin negotiating a reform for teaching employees in
-- colleges and seminars. Time is in days from the signing.
@ref akn:art_13 akn:art_13/p1
`the signing of the September 2013 agreement` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 17 9 2013
`the colleges negotiation begins by` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 15 10 2013

`beginning the negotiation on colleges` MEANS
    (PARTY `the State`
     MUST  `begin negotiating the reform for teaching employees in colleges and seminars`
     WITHIN DATE_SERIAL `the colleges negotiation begins by` MINUS DATE_SERIAL `the signing of the September 2013 agreement`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the teachers' union`
     MUST  `begin negotiating the reform for teaching employees in colleges and seminars`
     WITHIN DATE_SERIAL `the colleges negotiation begins by` MINUS DATE_SERIAL `the signing of the September 2013 agreement`)

§§ `14 קביעת רמת המורכבות של בתי הספר ושינוי טבלאות השכר של המנהלים`

-- (א): from תשע"ד the schools are placed in 8 complexity levels — where
-- §66(א) of the base agreement has four — and the principals' tables are
-- amended to match. (ה): only once a further collective agreement (ד) is
-- signed, and back to the start of תשע"ד.
@ref akn:art_14 akn:art_14__para_a akn:art_14__para_e
`complexity levels of a primary or junior high school from 5774` MEANS 8

#ASSERT `complexity levels of a primary or junior high school from 5774` GREATER THAN count (`the levels open to` `a primary or junior high school`)

GIVEN d IS A DATE, `the further agreement of (ד) is signed` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the complexity levels of a primary or junior high school on` d `the further agreement of (ד) is signed` IS
    IF `the further agreement of (ד) is signed` AND d `is on or after` (`the school year opening in` 2013)
    THEN `complexity levels of a primary or junior high school from 5774`
    ELSE count (`the levels open to` `a primary or junior high school`)

#ASSERT `the complexity levels of a primary or junior high school on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2013) TRUE EQUALS 8
#ASSERT `the complexity levels of a primary or junior high school on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2013) FALSE EQUALS 4

-- (ב): the cost of the change in principals' pay from the new levels and
-- tables is 22 million shekels at most in תשע"ד; (ג): the change of the
-- tables in תשע"ה, completing it, 20 million at most.
@ref akn:art_14__para_b akn:art_14__para_c
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the cost of the principals' tables change at most in the school year opening in` y IS
    BRANCH
        IF y EQUALS 2013 THEN JUST 22000000
        IF y EQUALS 2014 THEN JUST 20000000
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

-- (ד): the parties hold talks on the new principals' tables and on the
-- changes to §66 and the other sections they touch; what they agree is
-- anchored in a further collective agreement.
@ref akn:art_14__para_d
`talks on the principals' tables` MEANS
    (PARTY `the State`
     MUST  `hold talks on the new principals' tables and the changes to §66`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the teachers' union`
     MUST  `hold talks on the new principals' tables and the changes to §66`)

-- (ו): following §3 of the follow-up committee's decision of 12.3.2013,
-- until (ה) is applied, a principal who goes on leading the school he led
-- in תשע"ג is paid no differently from what he was entitled to in תשע"ג.
-- This is the "other agreement" that decision's §3 leaves room for: without
-- it, from תשע"ד the base agreement would have applied again and the
-- תשע"ג supplement stopped.
@ref akn:art_14__para_f
GIVEN p IS A `principal in 5773`, `(ה) is applied` IS A BOOLEAN, `the salary once (ה) is applied` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a continuing principal's pay from 5774 under the September 2013 agreement` p `(ה) is applied` `the salary once (ה) is applied` IS
    IF `(ה) is applied`
    THEN `the salary once (ה) is applied`
    ELSE `the 5773 salary under the decision of 12.3.2013` p

#ASSERT `a continuing principal's pay from 5774 under the September 2013 agreement` (`a principal at level 3 since 5769, at level` 2 `in 5773` FALSE (20%)) FALSE 0 EQUALS 11550
#ASSERT NOT `the base agreement as it stood before 12.3.2013 governs the principal's pay in the school year opening in` 2013 TRUE

-- (ז): this section applies also to principals of attached junior highs
-- and, as the parties will set, to first deputies; their costs are inside
-- (ב)–(ג)'s.
@ref akn:art_14__para_g
DECLARE `post §14 of the September 2013 agreement reaches` IS ONE OF
    `a school principal`
    `the principal of an attached junior high`
    `a first deputy, as the parties set`

`the posts §14 of the September 2013 agreement reaches` MEANS
    LIST `a school principal`, `the principal of an attached junior high`, `a first deputy, as the parties set`

