-- The negotiation on a wage agreement for תשע"ו begins on 1.4.2015; it
-- takes nothing from the exhaustion and industrial-peace provisions here.
@ref akn:art_15 akn:art_15/p1
`the negotiation for the wage agreement for 5776 begins on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 4 2015

`beginning the next wage negotiation` MEANS
