§§ `16 הסכמים והסדרים קודמים`

-- §153(א) of the base agreement goes on applying in this agreement's
-- period: an earlier term stays in force unless amended or cancelled.
@ref akn:art_16 akn:art_16/p1
GIVEN `amended or cancelled` IS A BOOLEAN, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an earlier term stays in force under the September 2013 agreement` `amended or cancelled` d IF
    `an earlier term stays in force` `amended or cancelled` (`in the September 2013 agreement's period` d)

#ASSERT `an earlier term stays in force under the September 2013 agreement` FALSE (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2014)

§§ `17 מיצוי תביעות`

-- (א): the agreement exhausts every claim on what it settles for the time
-- to 30.6.2015; no further economic demand is negotiated for its period.
@ref akn:art_17 akn:art_17__para_a
`no further economic demands for the September 2013 agreement's period` MEANS
    (PARTY `the State`
     SHANT `negotiate further economic demands for the agreement's period`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the teachers' union`
     SHANT `negotiate further economic demands for the agreement's period`)

-- (ב): (א) does not reach the negotiations of §§12 and 13, nor that on the
-- reform for the populations of §155(ב) as the completion agreement
-- amended it — save the special-education kindergartens whose hours were
-- longer before the reform and the long-day (יוח"א) kindergartens.
@ref akn:art_17__para_b
GIVEN pop IS A `population §155(ב) leaves to negotiation`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the September 2013 agreement leaves open the negotiation on` pop IF
        (NOT pop EQUALS `teaching employees in special-education kindergartens with longer hours before the reform`)
    AND (NOT pop EQUALS `teaching employees in long-day kindergartens`)

#ASSERT `the September 2013 agreement leaves open the negotiation on` `teaching employees in schools for gifted pupils`
#ASSERT NOT `the September 2013 agreement leaves open the negotiation on` `teaching employees in long-day kindergartens`

-- (ג): if a framework agreement is signed between the Histadrut and the
-- State or the public employers for this agreement's period or part of it,
-- the parties negotiate applying its cost to teaching employees, with this
-- agreement's cost in mind; the industrial peace of §18 stands.
@ref akn:art_17__para_c
GIVEN `a framework agreement is signed for the period` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `September 2013 agreement action`
DECIDE `negotiating a framework agreement's cost` `a framework agreement is signed for the period` IS
    IF `a framework agreement is signed for the period`
    THEN (PARTY `the State`
          MUST  `negotiate applying a framework agreement's cost to teaching employees`)
         RAND
         (PARTY `the teachers' union`
          MUST  `negotiate applying a framework agreement's cost to teaching employees`)
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- (ד): §155(א) of the base agreement — a framework agreement's cost
-- applied by a uniform rise of the tables if not agreed in 90 days — no
-- longer applies between the parties, from this agreement's period on.
-- F-ofek-hadash-september-2013-a: two months earlier the deferral of
-- 22.7.2013 put off to 1.1.2015 an allocation it says is made "בהתאם
-- להוראות סעיף 155(א)", and this withdraws that clause before the day.
-- The reading adopted (convention precedence.specific): the deferral,
-- which speaks of that one allocation, governs, and (ד) ends §155(א) for
-- the framework agreements (ג) speaks of; the allocation is made on
-- 1.1.2015.
@ref akn:art_17__para_d
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `§155(א) of the base agreement applies between the parties on` d IF
    NOT d `is on or after` `the September 2013 agreement's period opens on`

`§17(ד) withdraws the clause the deferred allocation is made under` MEANS
        `the clause the deferred allocation is made under` EQUALS "155(א)"
    AND NOT `§155(א) of the base agreement applies between the parties on` `the day the allocation of §92(ג) is made, as the deferral of 22.7.2013 puts it off`
#ASSERT `§17(ד) withdraws the clause the deferred allocation is made under`

-- By the reading adopted, the deferred allocation is made on 1.1.2015.
#ASSERT `the 2011 supplement rate under §92, as the deferral of 22.7.2013 puts off its last part` (2.5%) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2015) EQUALS 6.35%

§§ `18 שקט תעשייתי`

-- In the agreement's period, neither party nor any of its units takes
-- strike or lockout measures, whole or partial, or any other organised
-- disruption of work, on the matters the agreement settles — save the
-- matters of §17(ב).
@ref akn:art_18 akn:art_18/p1
`industrial peace under the September 2013 agreement` MEANS
    (PARTY `the State`
     SHANT `strike, lock out or disrupt work over a matter the September 2013 agreement settles`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the teachers' union`
     SHANT `strike, lock out or disrupt work over a matter the September 2013 agreement settles`)

